config BFLB_LPFW
	bool "Include the low-power firmware features"
	help
	  A vendor-provided binary runs in a dedicated retention RAM along with parameters and
	  after a CPU reset for its start address, handles the low-power operation with fewer
	  resources required than the main firmware, with the entire SoC powered off for everything
	  except the bare minimum for wireless operation.
